uff08FSI/SSI \u3068 Chassis DB / redis_chassis\uff09", "content_html": "VoQ\uff08Virtual Output Queue\uff09\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc\u30b7\u3067\u8907\u6570 ASIC \u3092 1 \u8ad6\u7406\u30eb\u30fc\u30bf\u3068\u3057\u3066\u52d5\u304b\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u9aa8\u683c\u8a2d\u8a08\u3002FSI/SSI \u5f79\u5272\u5206\u62c5\u3001redis_chassis \u4e0a\u306e CHASSIS_APP_DB\u3001chassisdb.conf \u306b\u3088\u308b\u8d77\u52d5\u5236\u5fa1\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/distributed-forwarding-in-a-virtual-output-queue-voq-architecture.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T18:05:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations/", "title": "Error Handling Framework \u8a2d\u5b9a\u30fb\u904b\u7528\uff08show / clear error-database / ERROR_DB \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\uff09", "content_html": "Error Handling Framework HLD \u306e CLI / ERROR_DB \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\u3002`show error-database` / `sonic-clear error-database` \u306e\u4f7f\u3044\u65b9\uff08HLD \u63d0\u6848\u3001\u73fe\u884c master \u672a\u5b9f\u88c5\uff09\u3001ERROR_ROUTE_TABLE / ERROR_NEIGH_TABLE \u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u3001\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u9077\u79fb\u8868\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:56:08+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/nat-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/nat-in-sonic/", "title": "NAT in SONiC\uff08natsyncd / NatOrch / iptables \u2194 SAI\uff09", "content_html": "NAT in SONiC\uff08natsyncd / NatOrch / iptables \u2194 SAI\uff09 \u2014 Linux kernel \u306e conntrack/iptables \u3092\u771f\u5b9f\u6e90\u3068\u3057\u3066\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2 NAT \u30a8\u30f3\u30b8\u30f3\uff08SAI NAT API\uff09\u306b\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u3092\u540c\u671f\u3059\u308b natsyncd / NatOrch \u306e 2 \u6bb5\u69cb\u6210\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/nat-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T01:09:59+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/", "title": "\u521d\u5b66\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "SONiC \u3092\u521d\u3081\u3066\u89e6\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u5411\u3051\u3002\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca / Redis DB / SAI / \u8a2d\u5b9a\u53cd\u6620\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u306e\u8f2a\u90ed\u3068\u3001\u5404 area \u3078\u306e\u5c0e\u7dda\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/beginner.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/", "title": "P4Orch\uff08PINS \u306e P4Runtime \u7528 orchagent / \u540c\u671f\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\uff09", "content_html": "P4Orch \u306f PINS (P4 Integrated Network Stack) \u306e\u4e2d\u6838 orchagent\u3002APPL_DB.P4RT \u3092\u8cfc\u8aad\u3057\u3001SAI \u3092\u540c\u671f\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3067\u53e9\u3044\u3066 P4Runtime controller \u306b\u5b8c\u4e86\u5fdc\u7b54\u3092\u8fd4\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/p4-orchagent.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T16:40:23+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/design-doc/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/design-doc/", "title": "gRPC client\uff08active-active DualToR / ycabled \u2194 SoC \u9023\u643a\uff09", "content_html": "DualToR active-active \u69cb\u6210\u306b\u304a\u3044\u3066 PMON \u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca\u5185\u306e gRPC client daemon \u304c ycabled / linkmgrd \u3068 SoC \u4e0a\u306e gRPC server \u3092 loopback IP / TLS \u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u63a5\u7d9a\u3057\u3001forwarding state \u3092\u53cc\u65b9\u5411\u306b\u3084\u308a\u53d6\u308a\u3059\u308b HLD \u306e\u89e3\u8aac\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/design-doc.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T00:53:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-syslog/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-syslog/", "title": "config syslog \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "config syslog \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 config syslog \u306f SONiC \u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u304a\u3088\u3073 feature \u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca\u306e syslog \u8a2d\u5b9a (\u30ea\u30e2\u30fc\u30c8\u9001\u4fe1\u5148 / \u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u5236\u9650 / \u30ed\u30b0\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb) \u3092 CONFIG_DB \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080 CLI \u3067\u3001config/syslog.py \u306e @click.group()\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-syslog.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:52:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/", "title": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09", "content_html": "HLD \u3068\u5b9f\u88c5\u306e\u4e56\u96e2 \u4e00\u89a7\uff08discrepancy-index\uff09 \u2014 verification: discrepancy-found \u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u305f\u5168\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092 monitor subtype \u5225\u306b\u5206\u985e\u3057\u305f\u4e00\u89a7\u3002meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py \u3067\u751f\u6210\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/mpls-tc-to-tc-map/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/mpls-tc-to-tc-map/", "title": "MPLS TC \u2192 TC map\uff08MPLS \u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u306e QoS classification\uff09", "content_html": "MPLS \u30d1\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u306e TC\uff08\u65e7 EXP\u3001RFC 5462\uff09\u304b\u3089\u5185\u90e8 TC \u3078\u306e classification map \u3092 SONiC \u306e\u65e2\u5b58 QoS \u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\uff08MPLS_TC_TO_TC_MAP \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb + PORT_QOS_MAP \u306e mpls_tc_to_tc_map \u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\uff09\u306b\u8ffd\u52a0\u3057\u3001 SAI_QOS_MAP_MPLS_EXP_TO_TC \u3092\u4ecb\u3057\u3066 ASIC \u306b\u964d\u308d\u3059\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/mpls-tc-to-tc-map.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:25:53+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document/", "title": "MACsec on SONiC\uff08wpa_supplicant + MACsec Mgr/Orch + SAI\uff09", "content_html": "MACsec on SONiC\uff08wpa_supplicant + MACsec Mgr/Orch + SAI\uff09 \u2014 IEEE 802.1AE / 802.1X-2010 \u6e96\u62e0\u306e Layer 2 \u6697\u53f7\u5316 \u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/macsec-sonic-high-level-design-document.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:27:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting/", "title": "\u30a6\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u65e2\u77e5\u554f\u984c\u3068\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "\u30a6\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u30fb\u9ad8\u901f\u30ea\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u65e2\u77e5\u554f\u984c\u3001syncd/SAI \u3068\u306e\u76f8\u4e92\u4f5c\u7528\u3001LAG \u30d5\u30e9\u30c3\u30d7\u3001SSH \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u5207\u65ad\u554f\u984c\u306a\u3069 sonic-buildimage issue tracker \u304b\u3089\u53ce\u96c6\u3057\u305f\u5b9f\u88c5\u4e0a\u306e\u6ce8\u610f\u70b9\u3002\n", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/warmboot-known-issues-and-troubleshooting.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-13T06:17:15+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/02-bgp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/02-bgp/", "title": "BGP \u3068 FRR \u5236\u5fa1\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30f3", "content_html": "BGP \u3068 FRR \u5236\u5fa1\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30f3 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e BGP \u3092\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u66f8\u304f\u5834\u6240\u300d\u300cFRR \u3078\u6e21\u308b\u7d4c\u8def\u300d\u300cASIC \u306b\u5165\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u7d4c\u8def\u300d\u300c\u904b\u7528\u4e2d\u306b\u898b\u308b\u5834\u6240\u300d\u306e\u9806\u306b\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002\u65e2\u5b58\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f HLD \u5358\u4f4d\u3067\u8a73\u3057\u3044\u304c\u3001BGP \u3092\u904b\u7528\u3059\u308b\u4eba\u304c\u6700\u521d\u306b\u77e5\u308a\u305f\u3044\u5883\u754c\u306f HLD \u306e\u5883\u754c\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/02-bgp/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:43:58+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/02-bgp/concept/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/02-bgp/concept/", "title": "\u6982\u8981", "content_html": "\u6982\u8981 \u2014 \u300cSONiC \u3067 BGP \u3092\u8aad\u3080\u300d\u3068\u304d\u306b\u6700\u521d\u306b\u3076\u3064\u304b\u308b\u56f0\u308a\u3054\u3068\u306f\u3001BGP \u30d7\u30ed\u30c8\u30b3\u30eb\u305d\u306e\u3082\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001SONiC \u3068 FRR \u306e\u5883\u754c\u304c\u3069\u3053\u306b\u3042\u308b\u304b \u304c\u898b\u3048\u3065\u3089\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/02-bgp/concept.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:43:58+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/", "title": "L2 / VLAN / LAG / MC-LAG", "content_html": "L2 / VLAN / LAG / MC-LAG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3092 L2 switch \u3068\u3057\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u3068\u304d\u306b\u6700\u521d\u306b\u8ff7\u3046\u300cVLAN\u3001VLAN interface\u3001switchport\u3001sub-port\u3001LAG\u3001MC-LAG \u306f\u3069\u306e\u9806\u756a\u3067\u7406\u89e3\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3088\u3044\u304b\u300d\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:52:45+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/advanced/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/advanced/", "title": "L2 \u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af", "content_html": "L2 \u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f\u3001\u901a\u5e38\u306e VLAN / PortChannel / MC-LAG \u8a2d\u8a08\u304b\u3089\u4e00\u6b69\u5916\u308c\u308b\u8a71\u984c\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002OpenConfig \u306f\u7ba1\u7406 API \u7ae0\u3001distributed VOQ LAG \u306f VOQ \u7ae0\u3001Wake-on-LAN \u306f\u904b\u7528\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u8aad\u3080\u5bfe\u8c61\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/06-l2-vlan-lag/advanced.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:54:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:52:45+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}